Breath of Fire III, its code, data and marks belong to Capcom. This project
claims no rights over them. The source holds decompiled C code and data tables
(item names, parameters, raw byte gaps) recovered from the retail game, and
hand-written assembly. It holds no disc image, executable, audio, graphics or
other media, and no object file. Users supply their own disc and build the
images from it.

